# spec: GET [1.10] multipoint on the 700 answers 03: bit 0 (on) and bit 1 (supported) set, bit 2 (can be turned off) clear, so it reads as on.
# source: NC 700 fw 1.8.2-11524+e0f7590, GET [1.10] = 03 (NOTES.md, NC 700 section); bit layout from the vendor app's isEnabled/isSupported/isDisableSupported
device nc700
call multipoint
send 01 0a 01 00
recv 01 0a 03 01 03
result ok on
